    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/d9699677ab3d75338b9f164e1806d2f5.poster.avif?t=1748998367\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/d9699677ab3d75338b9f164e1806d2f5.webm?t=1748998367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/d9699677ab3d75338b9f164e1806d2f5.mp4?t=1748998367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Immerse yourself in action-packed gameplay, where procedurally generated levels, and ever-evolving horrifying enemies adapt to your playstyle. <br><br>In Story Mode uncover the origins of these scary creatures and defeat them to unlock new items, levels, and enemies for Arena Mode. <br><br>Arena Mode allows you to customize levels, enemies, item drops, difficulty, and more to tailor your gaming experience. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/9b1866fbab5926f373a573ecfcaf1275.poster.avif?t=1748998367\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/9b1866fbab5926f373a573ecfcaf1275.webm?t=1748998367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/9b1866fbab5926f373a573ecfcaf1275.mp4?t=1748998367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your gameplay will evolve into unique experiences from the procedurally altered levels, environmental hazards, and randomized item spawns, allowing multiple fresh playthroughs. <br><br>Created by a passionate solo developer this game offers an action horror experience like no other.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/bc7a3c5b7d770ce763d6e457f860d53f.poster.avif?t=1748998367\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/bc7a3c5b7d770ce763d6e457f860d53f.webm?t=1748998367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/bc7a3c5b7d770ce763d6e457f860d53f.mp4?t=1748998367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Key features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> action packed gameplay<br></li><li> enemies that evolve depending on how you play the game<br></li><li> procedurally altered levels making each playthrough unique <br></li><li> destructible environments <br></li><li> unlocks and upgrades after you beat a level<br></li><li> different game modes including story and arena mode that allows you to customize levels <br></li><li> graphic settings, key rebinding, post processing effects settings, optimization settings, audio settings <br></li><li> 15 different language selections including: English, Chinese, French, German, Hindi, Italian, Japanese, Portuguese, Spanish, Korean, Russian, Polish, Thai, Vietnamese, and Indonesian</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/d9699677ab3d75338b9f164e1806d2f5.poster.avif?t=1748998367\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/d9699677ab3d75338b9f164e1806d2f5.webm?t=1748998367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/d9699677ab3d75338b9f164e1806d2f5.mp4?t=1748998367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Immerse yourself in action-packed gameplay, where procedurally generated levels, and ever-evolving horrifying enemies adapt to your playstyle. <br><br>In Story Mode uncover the origins of these scary creatures and defeat them to unlock new items, levels, and enemies for Arena Mode. <br><br>Arena Mode allows you to customize levels, enemies, item drops, difficulty, and more to tailor your gaming experience. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/9b1866fbab5926f373a573ecfcaf1275.poster.avif?t=1748998367\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/9b1866fbab5926f373a573ecfcaf1275.webm?t=1748998367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/9b1866fbab5926f373a573ecfcaf1275.mp4?t=1748998367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your gameplay will evolve into unique experiences from the procedurally altered levels, environmental hazards, and randomized item spawns, allowing multiple fresh playthroughs. <br><br>Created by a passionate solo developer this game offers an action horror experience like no other.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/bc7a3c5b7d770ce763d6e457f860d53f.poster.avif?t=1748998367\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/bc7a3c5b7d770ce763d6e457f860d53f.webm?t=1748998367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/bc7a3c5b7d770ce763d6e457f860d53f.mp4?t=1748998367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Key features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> action packed gameplay<br></li><li> enemies that evolve depending on how you play the game<br></li><li> procedurally altered levels making each playthrough unique <br></li><li> destructible environments <br></li><li> unlocks and upgrades after you beat a level<br></li><li> different game modes including story and arena mode that allows you to customize levels <br></li><li> graphic settings, key rebinding, post processing effects settings, optimization settings, audio settings <br></li><li> 15 different language selections including: English, Chinese, French, German, Hindi, Italian, Japanese, Portuguese, Spanish, Korean, Russian, Polish, Thai, Vietnamese, and Indonesian</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Armed with a diverse arsenal of weapons battle through ever-changing mazes and confront eerie, evolving enemies in a pulse-pounding survival horror action-packed experience.",
